window.docContents[175].resolve({"/Basic-Types/Arrays/#subarray":{"contents":"The type Subarray α is an abbreviations for Std.Slice α.\nThis means that, in addition to the operators in this section, generalized field notation can be used to call functions in the Std.Slice namespace, such as Std.Slice.foldl.\n\nA region of some underlying array.A subarray contains an array together with the start and end indices of a region of interest.\nSubarrays can be used to avoid copying or allocating space, while being more convenient than\ntracking the bounds by hand. The region of interest consists of every index that is both greater\nthan or equal to start and strictly less than stop.\n\nThe empty subarray.This empty subarray is backed by an empty array.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Basic Types\u0009Arrays","header":"20.16.5. Subarrays","id":"/Basic-Types/Arrays/#subarray"},"/Basic-Types/Natural-Numbers/#nat-api-predicates":{"contents":"Non-strict, or weak, inequality of natural numbers, usually accessed via the ≤ operator.Non-strict inequality is reflexive: n ≤ nIf n ≤ m, then n ≤ m + 1.\n\nStrict inequality of natural numbers, usually accessed via the < operator.It is defined as n < m = n + 1 ≤ m.\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Basic Types\u0009Natural Numbers\u0009API Reference\u0009Comparisons","header":"20.1.4.5.3. Predicates","id":"/Basic-Types/Natural-Numbers/#nat-api-predicates"},"/Build-Tools-and-Distribution/Lake/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Build-Tools-and-Distribution--Lake--Configuration-File-Format--Lean-Format--Targets--External-Libraries":{"contents":"由于外部库可以用任意语言编写并需要任意构建步骤，它们被定义为在 FetchM 单子中编写、生成 Job 的程序。\n外部库目标应生成一个执行构建并返回所得静态库位置的构建作业。\n要使外部库在启用 precompileModules 时正确链接，extern_lib 目标生成的静态库必须遵循平台的库命名约定（即在 Windows 上命名为 foo.a，在类 Unix 系统上命名为 libfoo.a）。\n实用函数 Lake.nameToStaticLib 将库名称转换为适合当前平台的文件名。\n\n外部库目标定义新的外部库包目标。只有一种形式：extern_lib «target-name» (pkg : NPackage _package.name) :=\n  /- 构造类型为 `FetchM (Job FilePath)` 的项 -/\npkg 参数（及其类型说明符）可省略。\n其类型为 NPackage _package.name，以可证明地表明所提供的包就是定义该目标的包。该项应构建外部库的静态库。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009构建工具\u0009Lake\u0009配置文件格式\u0009Lean 格式\u0009目标","header":"24.1.3.2.4.3. 外部库","id":"/Build-Tools-and-Distribution/Lake/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Build-Tools-and-Distribution--Lake--Configuration-File-Format--Lean-Format--Targets--External-Libraries"},"/Notations-and-Macros/Defining-New-Syntax/#syntax-construction-helpers":{"contents":"从名称创建标识符。所得标识符没有源位置。\n\n创建标识符，其位置从 src 复制。若要无变量捕获风险地指向特定常量，请改用 mkCIdentFrom。\n\n创建标识符，其位置从 getRef 返回的语法复制。若要无变量捕获风险地指向特定常量，请改用 mkCIdentFromRef。\n\n创建指向常量 c 的标识符。该标识符没有源位置。此 mkIdent 变体确保标识符不会意外被捕获。\n\n创建指向常量 c 的标识符。该标识符的位置从 src 复制。此 mkIdentFrom 变体确保标识符不会意外被捕获。\n\n创建指向常量 c 的标识符。该标识符的位置从 getRef 返回的语法复制。此 mkIdentFrom 变体确保标识符不会意外被捕获。\n\n创建表示 Lean 项应用的语法，同时避免产生退化的空应用。\n\n创建表示 Lean 常量应用的语法，同时避免产生退化的空应用。\n\n创建给定种类的字面量。调用者负责确保所提供的字面量是该种类的合法原子。若提供 info，则从中复制字面量的源信息。\n\n为给定字符创建字面量语法。若提供 info，则从中复制字面量的源信息。\n\n为给定字符串创建字面量语法。若提供 info，则从中复制字面量的源信息。\n\n为以字符串提供的数字创建字面量语法。调用者必须确保该字符串是 num 记号解析器的\n合法记号。若提供 info，则从中复制字面量的源信息。\n\n为自然数创建字面量语法。若提供 info，则从中复制字面量的源信息。\n\n为科学计数法数字创建字面量语法。调用者必须确保所提供的字符串是合法的科学计数法\n字面量。若提供 info，则从中复制字面量的源信息。\n\n为名称创建字面量语法。调用者必须确保所提供的字符串是合法的名称字面量。若提供 info，则从中复制字面量的源信息。\n\n创建可选节点。可选节点是包含零个或一个元素的空种类节点。\n\n创建仿佛由 Lean.Parser.group 解析得到的分组节点。\n\n创建空洞（_），并从 ref 复制空洞的位置。\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009记法与宏\u0009定义新语法","header":"23.4.9. 构造语法的辅助函数","id":"/Notations-and-Macros/Defining-New-Syntax/#syntax-construction-helpers"},"/ValidatingProofs/#Lean-__________________--Validating-a-Lean-Proof--Re-Checking-Proofs-with--lean4checker--Comments":{"contents":"Since lean4checker reads the .olean files without validating their format, this check is  prone to an attacker crafting invalid .olean files (e.g. invalid pointers, invalid data in strings).\n\nLean tactics and other meta-code can perform arbitrary actions when run.\nImporting libraries created by a determined malicious attacker and building them without further protection can compromise the user's system, after which no further meaningful checks are possible.\n\nWe recommend running lean4checker as part of CI for the additional protection against bugs in Lean's handling of declaration and as a deterrent against simple attacks.\nThe lean-action GitHub Action provides this functionality by setting lean4checker: true.\n\nWithout the --fresh flag the tool can be instructed to only check some modules, and assume others to be correct (e.g. trusted libraries), for faster processing.\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Validating a Lean Proof\u0009Re-Checking Proofs with  lean4checker","header":"Comments","id":"/ValidatingProofs/#Lean-__________________--Validating-a-Lean-Proof--Re-Checking-Proofs-with--lean4checker--Comments"},"/releases/v4.29.0/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Release-Notes--Lean-4___29___0-_LPAR_2026-03-27_RPAR_--Server":{"contents":"* #12197 修复了 System.Uri.fileUriToPath? 中无法使用的错误\n  它生成的路径中的默认 Windows 路径分隔符。* #12332 修复了新 NeoVim 版本上的一个问题，该问题会导致\n  语言服务器在使用某些代码操作时显示错误。* #12553 修复了不支持增量的命令的问题\n  当进行相关编辑时，他们的精译没有被打断\n  由用户。由于 def/theorem 的所有内置变体都有一个共同点\n  增量精译器，这可能对标准的影响可以忽略不计\n  精简文件，但可能会影响严重依赖自定义的其他用例\n  命令，例如 Verso。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009发行说明\u0009Lean4.29.0 (2026-03-27)","header":"服务器","id":"/releases/v4.29.0/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Release-Notes--Lean-4___29___0-_LPAR_2026-03-27_RPAR_--Server"}});